			"notes": "-Added Chocolate Factory Helper\n-Added a bunch of regions & a couple new areas to the Pack Swapper\n-Speedrunning the release notes because Hypixel's updating RIGHT NOW\n\n-Also updated one of the packs, it will not longer have untextured gray wool\n\nHOTFIX: Fixed a bug causing the Item Pickup Log's duration to multiply by 1000. Thanks Anthonino!\nHOTFIX 2: Attempted to fix a bug causing massive log file sizes.\nHOTFIX 3: Actually fixed the bug.\n\nRequires Fabric & the Fabric API for 1.20.4 to run.\nFabric: https://fabricmc.net/\n\nFabric API: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\nThis can just be placed into your mods folder.\n\n## What's Changed\n* 0.2.1 by @ThePurityOfChaos in https://github.com/ThePurityOfChaos/SkyblockImprovements/pull/12\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ThePurityOfChaos/SkyblockImprovements/compare/v0.2.0-beta...v0.2.1-beta"
